Method Path Notes GET <code>/nms/metadata/defaultview/myfiles/v1</code> Default view GET <code>/nms/metadata</code> Legacy view (supports <code>page</code> param) <p>Query params (both): - <code>limit</code> — page size (verified up to 2000) - <code>folderKey</code> — parent folder key (required) - <code>type</code> — only <code>f</code> (files) or <code>w</code> (folders); anything else → <code>400 NMSOM0129</code> - <code>sort</code> — e.g. <code>+fileCreatedDate</code>, <code>-lastModifiedDate</code>, <code>+objectName</code> - <code>page</code> — offset page index (legacy endpoint)</p> <p>Response envelope: <pre><code>{ "allocatedSpace": …, "usedSpace": …, "isUploadAllowed": true,
  "objects": [ { /* object schema — see DATA_MODELS.md */ } ] }
</code></pre></p> <p>SDK: <code>list_directory()</code>, <code>list_files()</code>, <code>list_folders()</code>, <code>stream_all_files()</code> (recursive walker; issues w+f queries per directory due to ISSUE-003), <code>search_files()</code> (client-side over full walk)</p>
